#! rate=44118 block=64 tracks=8 end=105882
# A parity scenario played on the panel with the lab switch (docs/16 MG3):
# track 1 plays the sound, track 2 sounds on USB-MIDI (the gate SEQ2), and
# panel-gestures.panel makes cables while it plays. The render legs replay
# what the native harness logged: these lines, the panel's commands, its
# knob turns (--param-at) and its modulation (the .mod log, --mod).
@0 tog 0 0 45 110;tog 0 3 57 80;tog 0 4 52 90;tog 0 6 55 80;tog 0 8 45 110
@0 tog 0 10 60 85;tog 0 11 59 75;tog 0 12 52 95;tog 0 14 57 80;slen 0 0 0 -1 40
@0 tog 1 0 69 100;tog 1 8 72 100
